      "proposed_content": "The conjectured moment constant separates two complementary inputs: truncated generalized-divisor diagonals produce the prime Euler factor a_k, while density-matched unitary characteristic-polynomial moments produce the Barnes-G factor g_k; a hybrid prime-and-zero model is one source-stated route to recovering their product.",
